ce sheet still contains the past</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch006.xhtml#c4-the-last-balance-sheet-still-contains-the-past" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-53" playOrder="53"><navLabel><text>The 1953 Trust waiting room</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch006.xhtml#c4-the-1953-trust-waiting-room" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-54" playOrder="54"><navLabel><text>So where did the money go?</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch006.xhtml#c4-so-where-did-the-money-go" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-55" playOrder="55"><navLabel><text>Conclusions supported by the accounts</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch006.xhtml#c4-conclusions-supported-by-the-accounts" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-56" playOrder="56"><navLabel><text>Main sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch006.xhtml#c4-main-sources" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-57" playOrder="57"><navLabel><text>Limitations</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch006.xhtml#c4-limitations" /></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-58" playOrder="58"><navLabel><text>The European laboratory</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch007.xhtml" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-59" playOrder="59"><navLabel><text>Deutsche Bank and Epstein: the compliance exception</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch008.xhtml" /><navPoint id="navPoint-60" playOrder="60"><navLabel><text>The risk was in the file</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch008.xhtml#c5-the-risk-was-in-the-file" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-61" playOrder="61"><navLabel><text>In 2015, control tightened on paper</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch008.xhtml#c5-in-2015-control-tightened-on-paper" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-62" playOrder="62"><navLabel><text>The limited reach of account signals</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch008.xhtml#c5-the-limited-reach-of-account-signals" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-63" playOrder="63"><navLabel><text>An exit decided in December, completed after the arrest</text></nav