nt inherited in an acquisition</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c7-bnp-paribas-a-fortis-retail-account-inherited-in-an-acquisition" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-84" playOrder="84"><navLabel><text>UBS: the client rejected, the linked person retained</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c7-ubs-the-client-rejected-the-linked-person-retained" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-85" playOrder="85"><navLabel><text>Deutsche Bank and Barclays: two records already established</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c7-deutsche-bank-and-barclays-two-records-already-established" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-86" playOrder="86"><navLabel><text>Public questions for the holders of the records</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c7-public-questions-for-the-holders-of-the-records" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-87" playOrder="87"><navLabel><text>Method: identify each relationship and its evidence</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c7-method-identify-each-relationship-and-its-evidence" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-88" playOrder="88"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c7-sources" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-89" playOrder="89"><navLabel><text>Limitations</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c7-limitations" /></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-90" playOrder="90"><navLabel><text>Conclusion: opacity fragments the figures</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml" /></navPoint><navPoint id="navPoint-91" playOrder="91"><navLabel><text>About this edition</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml" /></navPoint></navMap>
